# Force the www subdomain to the canonical apex domain (matches astro.config's
# `site` and every canonical/OG/sitemap URL in this project). Without this,
# Cloudflare would happily serve identical content at both hosts if a visitor
# ever adds the www custom domain, which Google can flag as duplicate,
# non-canonical content instead of a clean redirect to the indexed URL.
https://www.solahairsalon.com/* https://solahairsalon.com/:splat 301!
